    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The RPG with a Beat 'em Up Battle System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snakes with Fists! combines the open-world exploration elements of an RPG\u2014interesting NPCs, side quests, secrets, and a strong narrative\u2014with the fun of fighting in the beat 'em up style! Open areas are explored in a top down 2d RPG world, Beat 'em UP stages are entered and cleared to unlock new areas and to complete quests.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Also, you can fight anyone!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can... but should you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of 'random encounters' you will enter into a Beat 'em Up style fight scene with anyone you punch in the RPG world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The RPG with a Beat 'em Up Battle System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snakes with Fists! combines the open-world exploration elements of an RPG\u2014interesting NPCs, side quests, secrets, and a strong narrative\u2014with the fun of fighting in the beat 'em up style! Open areas are explored in a top down 2d RPG world, Beat 'em UP stages are entered and cleared to unlock new areas and to complete quests.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Also, you can fight anyone!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can... but should you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of 'random encounters' you will enter into a Beat 'em Up style fight scene with anyone you punch in the RPG world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
